
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>MATIN KIM — OFF THE CLOCK | Print Campaign</title>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --cream: #EAE2D3;
  --dark: #232323;
  --navy: #68758A;
  --burgundy: #6E333D;
  --stone: #9C998D;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--dark);
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 24px 6%;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa397;
}

.logo {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.nav-links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 25px;
}

.nav-links a {
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
}

.hero {
  background: var(--dark);
  color: var(--cream);
  padding: 110px 6% 100px;
  min-height: 65vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
}

.small-label {
  font-size: 10px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-style: italic;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: clamp(70px, 13vw, 170px);
  line-height: .82;
  margin: 35px 0;
}

.hero .tagline {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 30px;
  font-style: italic;
}

.intro {
  max-width: 850px;
  padding: 100px 25px;
  margin: auto;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.intro h2 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 55px;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin: 0 0 25px;
}

.section-heading {
  padding: 40px 7%;
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 45px;
  border-top: 1px solid #aaa397;
}

.ad {
  padding: 40px 7% 110px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #bbb2a5;
}

.ad-number {
  font-size: 11px;
  color: var(--burgundy);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.ad h2 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: clamp(45px, 7vw, 85px);
  margin: 20px 0 35px;
}

.ad img {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  max-height: 900px;
  object-fit: contain;
  background: #c6beb2;
}

.ad-details {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 35px;
  padding-top: 25px;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

.description {
  max-width: 570px;
}

.product {
  color: var(--burgundy);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.placement {
  text-align: right;
  font-weight: 500;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
}

.palette {
  padding: 70px 7%;
}

.palette h2 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 55px;
}

.colors {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
  gap: 12px;
}

.color {
  height: 140px;
  border-radius: 3px;
}

.color-name {
  margin-top: 12px;
  font-size: 11px;
}

.identity {
  padding: 65px 7% 100px;
  border-top: 1px solid #aaa397;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 50px;
}

.identity h2 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: 50px;
  font-weight: 400;
}

.identity p {
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.9;
}

footer {
  background: var(--dark);
  color: var(--cream);
  padding: 90px 25px;
  text-align: center;
}

footer h2 {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  font-size: clamp(55px, 10vw, 120px);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: italic;
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.disclaimer {
  font-size: 10px;
  opacity: .65;
  margin-top: 65px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

@media(max-width: 700px) {
  nav {
    padding: 18px 5%;
  }
  .nav-links {
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 9px;
  }
  .ad-details {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .placement {
    text-align: left;
  }
  .colors {
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .color {
    height: 80px;
  }
  .color-name {
    font-size: 9px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .identity {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- NAVIGATION -->

<nav>
  <div class="logo">Matin Kim</div>

  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#campaign">CAMPAIGN</a>
    <a href="#ads">PRINT ADS</a>
    <a href="#identity">IDENTITY</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- CAMPAIGN HERO -->

<section class="hero" id="campaign">
  <div class="small-label">
    MATIN KIM PRESENTS<br>
    SPRING 2027 / NEW YORK CITY
  </div>

  <h1>OFF THE<br>CLOCK</h1>

  <p class="tagline">No plans. Just presence.</p>

  <div class="small-label">
    THE NYC HEADWEAR COLLECTION
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CAMPAIGN DESCRIPTION -->

<section class="intro">
  <div class="small-label">
    CREATIVE DIRECTOR PT. 4
  </div>

  <h2>The City Never Stops.</h2>

  <p>
    OFF THE CLOCK is a fictional Spring 2027
    headwear launch for Matin Kim, inspired by
    Korean minimalist streetwear and the everyday
    rhythm of New York City.
  </p>

  <p>
    Through five print advertisements, the
    campaign explores effortless personal style,
    individuality, and the freedom to move through
    the city at your own pace.
  </p>
</section>

<div class="section-heading" id="ads">
  THE PRINT CAMPAIGN / 01—05
</div>

<!-- AD 1 -->

<section class="ad">
  <div class="ad-number">01 / SOHO BILLBOARD</div>

  <h2>No plans. Just presence.</h2>

  <img
    src="images/01-soho-billboard.png"
    alt="Matin Kim After Hours cap campaign on a SoHo billboard"
    loading="lazy">

  <div class="ad-details">
    <p class="description">
      <span class="product">
        AFTER HOURS — WASHED BLACK
      </span><br>
      A cinematic billboard featuring the washed
      black Matin Kim cap, oversized charcoal
      outerwear, and authentic SoHo architecture.
      Inspired by minimalist Korean fashion
      and vintage 35mm photography.
    </p>

    <p class="placement">
      SOHO, MANHATTAN<br>
      HORIZONTAL BILLBOARD / 16:9
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AD 2 -->

<section class="ad">
  <div class="ad-number">02 / NYC SUBWAY</div>

  <h2>Last train. First impression.</h2>

  <img
    src="images/02-subway-ad.png"
    alt="Matin Kim Last Train burgundy cap subway advertisement"
    loading="lazy">

  <div class="ad-details">
    <p class="description">
      <span class="product">
        LAST TRAIN — BURGUNDY
      </span><br>
      A vertical subway advertisement featuring
      the burgundy cap against the movement
      of New York public transportation.
      Soft lighting and muted tones create
      a nostalgic editorial aesthetic.
    </p>

    <p class="placement">
      NEW YORK CITY SUBWAY<br>
      VERTICAL POSTER / 2:3
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AD 3 -->

<section class="ad">
  <div class="ad-number">
    03 / LOWER EAST SIDE STREET POSTERS
  </div>

  <h2>Made for the in-between.</h2>

  <img
    src="images/03-wheatpaste-ad.png"
    alt="Matin Kim Downtown Blue wheatpaste poster installation"
    loading="lazy">

  <div class="ad-details">
    <p class="description">
      <span class="product">
        DOWNTOWN BLUE — FADED NAVY
      </span><br>
      A series of wheat-pasted fashion posters
      displayed across a weathered brick wall.
      The distressed textures and minimalist
      editorial typography connect the campaign
      with downtown NYC street culture.
    </p>

    <p class="placement">
      LOWER EAST SIDE, MANHATTAN<br>
      WHEATPASTE POSTER INSTALLATION
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AD 4 -->

<section class="ad">
  <div class="ad-number">
    04 / BROOKLYN BUS SHELTER
  </div>

  <h2>Take your time.</h2>

  <img
    src="images/04-bus-shelter.png"
    alt="Matin Kim Slow Morning beige cap bus shelter campaign"
    loading="lazy">

  <div class="ad-details">
    <p class="description">
      <span class="product">
        SLOW MORNING — VINTAGE BEIGE
      </span><br>
      An everyday coffee-run moment captured
      through relaxed styling and soft natural
      lighting. The advertisement celebrates
      quiet, unplanned moments in the city.
    </p>

    <p class="placement">
      BROOKLYN, NEW YORK<br>
      VERTICAL BUS SHELTER AD
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- AD 5 -->

<section class="ad">
  <div class="ad-number">
    05 / FASHION MAGAZINE EDITORIAL
  </div>

  <h2>Your day. Your pace.</h2>

  <img
    src="images/05-magazine-ad.png"
    alt="Matin Kim Off The Clock complete headwear collection magazine advertisement"
    loading="lazy">

  <div class="ad-details">
    <p class="description">
      <span class="product">
        THE COMPLETE COLLECTION
      </span><br>
      A double-page fashion editorial presenting
      the four cap colorways through portrait
      photography, elegant serif typography,
      and a restrained cream-and-charcoal
      color palette.
    </p>

    <p class="placement">
      NYC FASHION MAGAZINE<br>
      DOUBLE-PAGE EDITORIAL SPREAD
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COLOR PALETTE -->

<section class="palette" id="identity">
  <div class="small-label">VISUAL IDENTITY</div>

  <h2>Our Colors.</h2>

  <div class="colors">

    <div>
      <div class="color" style="background:#232323;"></div>
      <div class="color-name">CHARCOAL<br>#232323</div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="color" style="background:#EAE2D3;border:1px solid #B8AFA2;"></div>
      <div class="color-name">CREAM<br>#EAE2D3</div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="color" style="background:#68758A;"></div>
      <div class="color-name">FADED NAVY<br>#68758A</div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="color" style="background:#6E333D;"></div>
      <div class="color-name">BURGUNDY<br>#6E333D</div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="color" style="background:#9C998D;"></div>
      <div class="color-name">STONE<br>#9C998D</div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- STYLE GUIDE -->

<section class="identity">

  <div>
    <div class="small-label">CAMPAIGN TYPE SYSTEM</div>
    <h2>Typography.</h2>

    <p>
      <strong>Cormorant Garamond</strong><br>
      Editorial headlines, campaign slogans,
      and expressive typography.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Inter</strong><br>
      Product descriptions, navigation,
      campaign dates, and supporting information.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <div class="small-label">ART DIRECTION</div>
    <h2>Creative Vision.</h2>

    <p>
      Minimal Korean streetwear meets
      downtown New York City.
      The imagery combines washed fabrics,
      oversized styling, candid portraits,
      film-inspired grain, natural lighting,
      and everyday urban environments.
    </p>

    <p>
      The campaign emphasizes authenticity,
      individuality, and effortless fashion.
    </p>
  </div>

</section>

<!-- FOOTER -->

<footer>

  <div class="small-label">
    MATIN KIM / SPRING 2027 / NEW YORK CITY
  </div>

  <h2>OFF THE CLOCK</h2>

  <p>No plans. Just presence.</p>

  <p class="disclaimer">
    Creative Director Pt. 4: Print Ads<br>
    Unofficial student-created campaign concept.<br>
    Not affiliated with or endorsed by Matin Kim.
  </p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
